    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/93adc42d9421a66fb81d0465556ad2fe.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Biggest Fool:DURAK bar, where you will have to play DURAK to repay your debt to the Soviet Mafia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Durak Rules</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are using the base Durak rules with a few extra additions where you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the cards to the next oponent;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw/Attack with up to 6 cards from your hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/8304ab90f0b04477f316a3df39dca765.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Have YOU Got the Balls to Cheat?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also decided to spice up The Biggest Fool:DURAK card game version with the ability to cheat, to gain that extra advantage!<br>But be careful, you might get caught, and face the consequences! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Russian Roullette!</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/3db61fcd47853ada1eab73555e50396c.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Join Our Party!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of music styles to pick from, different performers and other NPC Interactions that will help you win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/c971a939b8838171b35eaaf40856a1d5.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/8e47be3d8ce905f119fbd48c98469275.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Thank you for your support!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/81c3bad51639d7826c9d6542cecfeee6.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/93adc42d9421a66fb81d0465556ad2fe.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Biggest Fool:DURAK bar, where you will have to play DURAK to repay your debt to the Soviet Mafia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Durak Rules</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are using the base Durak rules with a few extra additions where you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the cards to the next oponent;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw/Attack with up to 6 cards from your hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/8304ab90f0b04477f316a3df39dca765.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Have YOU Got the Balls to Cheat?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also decided to spice up The Biggest Fool:DURAK card game version with the ability to cheat, to gain that extra advantage!<br>But be careful, you might get caught, and face the consequences! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Russian Roullette!</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/3db61fcd47853ada1eab73555e50396c.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Join Our Party!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of music styles to pick from, different performers and other NPC Interactions that will help you win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/c971a939b8838171b35eaaf40856a1d5.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/8e47be3d8ce905f119fbd48c98469275.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Thank you for your support!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563570/extras/81c3bad51639d7826c9d6542cecfeee6.avif?t=1741707943\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "You owe the mafia a lot of money and your only way out is through high-stakes DURAK. Play your cards right, have the balls to cheat, or face consequences. In this MULTIPLAYER experience, you\u2019ll gamble your life to clear your debt. But be warned! - losing means more than just an empty wallet.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
